LuPerry.com

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:47.810
Koganei...

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.060
...Tenga-dono.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:53.020
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Koganei Tenga

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.850
Kuzuryuu Momoko-dono...

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:52.640
...and Inuzuka Koushi.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:53.270
Right?

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.180
Yes.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.440
We are here to receive the antidote.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:58.700
Poison, huh?

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.900
It must be the doings of my sister.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.000
What disgrace.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.230
Never the less, she is my family.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.430
I apologize.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:11.920
I will die at sunset if I don't drink the antidote.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.750
I need the antidote that is in your possession.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:20.210
I'm sure a person who is willing to apologize for his sister will listen to my request.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:21.180
How about it?

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.000
I've been thinking.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.830
Martial arts have rules just like baseball and soccer.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:32.700
You, who think using poison is disgraceful, should obey those rules.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.310
I too, follow rules.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.910
The rules of the Japanese society.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.200
In other words, law.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.710
Justice exists because there is law.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.280
Even if we fight...

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.540
Indeed, there are rules in martial arts.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:45.980
Rules that can never be violated.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:47.180
That's right.

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:51.640
By following those rules, I ask you for a duel.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:52.450
Eh?

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.650
Power is the justice of a martial artist.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:55.250
Eh!?

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.910
I will defeat you!

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.320
To the Usual Days

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:07.550
Momoko-chan.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.780
Please protect Inuzuka-kun.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.230
Please.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.090
Is it gonna be alright?

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.780
Don't worry.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.330
They won't win against Tenga-nii.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.490
So that's why you gave us the antidote?

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:22.560
Not really.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.700
I just didn't feel like fighting anymore.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.270
Let me tell you.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:30.690
You guys have no chance to win against their true strength.

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:31.760
It's impossible.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.900
In the Koganei clan, Tenga-nii has...

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:35.870
No...

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:39.670
He has obtained a power forgotten by the majority of martial artists.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:40.640
What?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.530
It has begun.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.530
You are not going to listen to Koushi-dono's request?

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.350
Fight, if you are a martial artist.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.230
I was so naive...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.210
I thought I could talk him out of it.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:56.280
In that case...

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.760
You will face me before you fight Koushi-dono.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:01.900
Haira Ichiden...

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.570
...Musou style, ultimate technique!

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:08.560
Black Dragon Morning Destroyer!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.130
He blocked it?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.740
But he can't fight anymore with that injury.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:30.090
Is this the technique I saw last time?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.230
Its power has increased.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:33.480
Interesting.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:43.150
Tenga-nii has awakened a power of our ancestor, the god of war, from the time when pride was everything.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.940
A power?

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.610
He would take as much damage as he can...

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.090
...then tissue regeneration would activate...

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:53.080
...which also grants him super human strength.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.590
The lost power of the Shindara Rettetsu style...

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.540
Mouko Mugen Kyuushin Soukou.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.540
Translation: A fierce tiger's unlimited reinforcement armor.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.000
His wounds are healed and his battle aura multiplied...

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.010
Here I come!

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:09.560
What was that?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.100
It's over.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:13.860
Senpai...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.710
What just happened?

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.670
That hurts...

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.110
I'm bleeding...

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.840
He's scary...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:31.940
Come here.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.170
What's with that sight?

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.870
Are you really the heir of the Inuzuka clan?

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.660
Where is she...?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:39.480
She...

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:40.360
Momoko...

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.210
Come on...

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:47.830
Kuzuryuu Momoko died while protecting you.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.530
Your life was given to you, so are you still not going to fight?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:55.050
I only looked at martial arts from aside until now...

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.540
Things always worked out when she was around...

00:05:59.010 --> 00:05:59.600
Momoko!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.520
It's useless.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.750
Now fight me.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.100
Ba... Basara...

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:06.730
...Fudou Shingan style...

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:07.990
...ultimate technique...

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.560
Ten... jou...

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.430
Let's see...

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.850
Tenjou tenge...

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.960
...Yuiga dokuson!

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:15.930
Kill with my eyes...

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.400
What are you doing?

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.580
Why did Kuzuryuu Momoko protect a man like this?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.690
I'm sorry, it's all because of me.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.330
I'll let you experience death ten thousand times.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.550
I deserve it.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.950
I told you your opponent is me.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:36.810
It's you...

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.000
You endured my hit?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.100
I see.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.680
She raised her battle aura to form a protective barrier.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.200
I won't let you hurt Koushi-dono any further.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:50.780
It looks like I'll enjoy my fight with you.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:51.660
Huh?

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.030
Thank god.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.250
Thank god, Mo...

00:06:58.880 --> 00:06:59.600
Momoko?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:02.680
No...

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.690
She was poisoned after me...

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.570
But it's spreading faster...

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:08.800
Why?

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:10.020
Why?

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.790
I don't want her to die.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.240
But there is nothing I can do.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:18.380
I'm so sorry.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.200
Koushi-dono...

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.490
Momoko, stay with me.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.240
Are you okay?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.220
I feel better now.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:26.290
I see.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:28.360
Here is the medicine.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.650
Make the antidote.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:34.170
Killing a person who is weakened by poison is not my style.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:40.890
Kuzuryuu Momoko used up too much of her battle aura to protect you.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.590
The speed for which the poison spreads has increased.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.690
As always...

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:49.240
As always, you are doing everything for me.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.530
And now you are suffering.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.570
Why didn't I notice it before all this happened?

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.050
No...

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:56.770
No.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.820
I knew it all along.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.290
From her...

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:02.420
...kindness.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.810
That antidote is for only one person.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.890
I was told that it was unnecessary to make extras.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.680
Make the decision.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.450
Who shall live on as a true martial artist.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.790
There is no time.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.840
Please drink it.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.660
I'm alright.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.960
Now that we have the antidote, Iroha-dono can make more after analyzing it.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:33.220
I'll take it after you.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.210
I can make it on time.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.190
That's what we all decided on before we came here.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.640
What are you talking about?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.090
Your poison is progressing faster.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:45.120
Drink it.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.160
Go ahead.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.510
Koushi-dono...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:48.540
But...

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:49.450
It's not what you think.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.750
This is not about kindness.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.000
I got it.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:53.660
Finally...

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.210
I'm not worth being protected by you.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.290
Everyone expected a lot from me.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:08.040
I was a person who kept running away from martial arts, and was afraid to fight.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.300
I'm pathetic.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.440
I tried to train myself.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.730
But there was nothing I could do at the end.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.830
The true martial artist...

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:18.940
That's not true.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:24.650
Rather than as a martial artist, you are shining with strength as a human being.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.070
You are overflowing with power.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:31.520
As a member of the dragon clan, who values inner strength, I understand.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.320
This is not comforting.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:38.750
This is about the potential of a human being.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.690
Believe in yourself.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.240
You can become whatever you want.

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.840
You, who I love...

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.080
Koushi-dono...

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.720
We can't wait until they come back.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:54.660
Let's go, Hanzo.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:55.790
Yes, sis.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.330
Us too.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:57.900
Yeah.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.880
Why are you following us?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.700
Because we are curious.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.560
It's about time the poison takes its effect.

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:07.030
And...

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.760
The sun is setting.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:11.900
Onii-chan...

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.630
As long as I live...

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.900
I can become whatever I want.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.820
Inuzuka-kun...

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.510
Momoko-chan...!

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:44.870
Momoko!

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:45.710
Inuzuka!

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:46.650
How's the fight?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:47.970
See for yourself.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:49.670
Over there.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.280
Onii-chan...?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.600
Momoko...!

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.860
The poison...

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.180
...has spread through their bodies.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:06.560
But...

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:07.690
What about the antidote?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.390
Momoko...

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.210
They couldn't have lost...

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.810
I'll make the antidote...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.880
To cure Momoko senpai...

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.890
So everyone can go home...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.530
To see them...

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.530
The match...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.770
Sis!

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.180
Inuzuka's friends, huh?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.010
And you are Tenka.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.490
Shut up, or I'll crush your jaw!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.470
"Martial artist is about strength"?

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.170
"Power is everything"?

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:48.850
You stole everything that's more important from me!

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.210
He hit him!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:53.900
No way.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.350
Isn't there anyone who can make me use my full strength?

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:03.670
Look at me!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:10.010
Is there anyone in this world who can fight against me?

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:17.010
I can't forgive myself the most, to be born into this boring era.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.330
Damn...

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:22.850
I can barely move, but I'll slit your throat...

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.230
It's useless.

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.490
Even Momoko-chan couldn't win.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:30.950
Brother...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.090
So you drank the antidote.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.500
Wise decision.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.360
Now fight me!

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:01.530
Shut up.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.040
She neutralized it with her battle aura?

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.150
That's it, I love that.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.350
That's more like my opponent.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:17.610
Koushi-dono...

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.090
Forget about a dead man!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:32.360
Momoko senpai is alive...

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.210
But what happened to her?

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.340
That power...

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.010
Ancient power.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:41.720
I'm sure the sadness has awakened her hidden ancient power.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.050
I've never seen Tenga-nii get beaten like that.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:46.770
Is it over?

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.030
Look!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.490
Even after that hit...

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:56.820
With tissue regeneration...

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:57.920
And...!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.500
So this is it.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.890
The ancient power of the Haira Ichiden Musou style.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.460
The battle aura of a dragon.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:12.990
I'm one step closer to become the god of war, thanks to your power.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.870
To show my appreciation.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.910
I'll crush you with my full strength.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:21.900
Koushi-dono...

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.320
Koushi-dono.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.020
Koushi-dono!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:31.320
You are irreplaceable to me.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.040
My memory of you...

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:41.310
...eased my loneliness when I was little.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:48.210
The days when I was with you, changed my once lonely world.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.350
And they changed the color of my world.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:56.660
The kindness of a family, and the joy of falling in love...

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:01.930
You taught me all that.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:08.840
What's wrong?

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:11.700
You can't defeat me with hesitation.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.730
Now you are dead!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:16.910
You disappeared!

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.160
You were killed!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:23.420
Our life and our destiny...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.920
Her attack power is about the same as mine.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:31.220
I need to use my superior speed to get around her attacks, and take her out in one hit.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:34.070
...were more important to me than anything.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:36.760
You...

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.470
Koushi-dono's life!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.650
Our daily life...

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.880
His kindness...

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.030
And his warmth...!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:51.410
<i>Momoko.</i>

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.430
I couldn't...

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.220
...protect our tomorrow.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:57.350
Gotcha.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:00.110
Koushi-dono.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.000
<i>Hey, what do you want to become?</i>

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.120
<i>A martial artist!</i>

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.800
<i>That's what daddy said.</i>

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.810
<i>Stay still for a while.</i>

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:13.630
<i>Mom.</i>

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:14.760
<i>What's this?</i>

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.650
<i>Koushi is a kind boy who would never hurt anyone.</i>

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:23.250
<i>If you did that, you would be really sad, right?</i>

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.420
<i>So...</i>

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.200
<i>Let's make this power sleep inside of you.</i>

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.650
<i>Painful memories caused by your parents...</i>

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.400
<i>You won't ever have to experience them.</i>

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.700
<i>This power will protect you.</i>

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:41.810
You are mine!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.620
Haira Ichiden...

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.950
Koushi-dono...

00:16:55.400 --> 00:17:01.010
<i>In that case, until the day you acknowledge me, I will do everything I can to change myself.</i>

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.390
Have you acknowledged me a little yet?

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.480
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:07.890
<i>I'm Kuzuryuu Momoko, the daughter of the master of the Haira Ichiden Musou Style, Kuzuryuu Sendayuu.</i>

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.000
I don't mind if I'm not strong.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.890
I really wanted to...

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:10.990
<i>I'm here to make babies with Inuzuka Koushi-dono!</i>

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:11.840
...bare your children.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.220
...Musou style.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.200
Ultimate technique.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:20.560
Translation: True force of a rising dragon that can rip through the sky.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:20.560
Shin Shouryuu Retten Shou!!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:25.050
Shit...!

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:34.570
Translation: The rising dragon that can split the sky, that is the Shin Shouryuu Retten Shou.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.440
It's in two pieces...

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.020
It's like the sky was cut in half.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.020
Tenga-nii...

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:36.940
Where is Tenga-nii?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.320
He got blown away.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.080
Tenga's battle aura is fading.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:42.480
We won!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:44.530
Momoko!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.370
Koushi-dono...

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.910
Momoko, that's enough.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.270
You won.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.320
It's over.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:51.500
Everything...

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.570
Everything is over!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:00.370
It's over...

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.970
Everything...

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.710
The marking disappeared.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:08.840
Really?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:27.610
Thank god.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:28.690
Everyone...

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:30.530
I'll wait for you to come back.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.010
Brother, brother!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:34.000
Shit...

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:37.010
He is still alive, but the regeneration is not working.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:41.130
Did I lose?

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.140
Yeah.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.510
Inuzuka Koushi, huh?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.580
Interesting guy.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:51.730
Well, Tenga-nii is smiling, let's just let him be.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:52.540
Yeah.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.820
Koushi-chan, you are alive.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.560
Let's go home!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.270
To our broken down apartment.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:13.450
I slept for three days after I came back.

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:15.520
Why I was still alive.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.770
What happened after the sunset.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.140
I couldn't come up with an answer.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.290
Inuzuka-kun, let's have lunch.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:24.140
Sure.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.580
I made a lot today again.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:27.660
Hello.

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.020
Koushi senpai!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:29.840
Let's eat.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.130
Hurry up.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.060
The usual members are here.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:33.710
Yeah.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.740
Why didn't you wake me up!?

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:42.910
I'm gonna be late...

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:44.310
No...

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:45.830
...way.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:50.200
Everything is supposed to be back to normal.

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.730
But it feels different somehow.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.800
You are Inuzuka Koushi, right?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:55.420
Yes.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.400
I'm Ushi Kamen from the western branch.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.400
Note: Ushi Kamen means Masked Cow.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.080
I'm here to take your life.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:02.780
Is there no peace for me?

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.860
She only cheers me from afar like always...

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.420
<i>Do your best, Koushi-dono!</i>

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.550
<i>It's not life threatening.</i>

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:13.360
<i>But she'll be taking some rest for the next fifty days.</i>

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:15.980
Like always, huh?

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.630
We only lived together for a few months.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.540
Koushi-dono!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:21.530
I'm hearing things again.

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:26.590
Koushi-dono!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:37.790
I'm sorry, I ran for ten hours, and I couldn't stop.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.640
Koushi-dono, you look well.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:44.340
It's still six in the morning, you are leaving already?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.010
Is there a clock on my face?

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.550
Have you had breakfast?

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.390
I'll make some right away if not.

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.610
Then I'll do some cleaning.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:52.780
Then we can go to school.

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.100
So this is it.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.730
I have to admit.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:59.940
I have already gotten used to her company.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:02.860
But don't do it again...

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.000
That depressing kiss.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:05.410
Eh?

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:08.700
The sadness I felt through your lips when you fed me the antidote.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:12.060
Though faint, I can never forget it.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.130
Keep it down already.

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:17.480
Momoko!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.280
Momoko senpai!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:20.750
Momoko-chan!

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.960
Long time no see, everyone.

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:26.940
Kuzuryuu Momoko is back!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:33.450
May tonight be...

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:33.450
今夜もしかして

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:33.450
konya moshikashite

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:37.880
Le... Le... Le... Le... Le... Let's fight!

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:37.880
ガッガッガッガガガチで勝負する

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:37.880
gaggaggaggaga gachide shoubu suru

